      "writtenOn": "2020-02-03T20:49:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like needProvision should contain the same string only once -- have you considered using a Set instead of a List? A Set would be much more efficient, as contains() here does a linear scan of the whole list, while a common implementation like HashSet takes constant time. Moreover, you could simplify this snippet by removing the if check, and always add, since the set implementation here guarantees that a given string will be present at most once.",
